  101,Introduction to q-de Rham Cohomology,"https://guests.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/ferdinand/q-deRham.pdf",mpg.de,math.AG,math.AG math.DG math.NT mathematics differential-geometry prismatic-cohomology survey,null,null,null,"Introduction to q-de Rham Cohomology. Ferdinand Wagner's exposition of $q$-de Rham cohomology, $q$-connections, and Habiro rings."
