  2368,Scaling Limits of Loop-Erased Random Walks and Uniform Spanning Trees,"https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9904022",arxiv.org,math.PR,math.PR mathematics markov-chains probability statistical-mechanics arxiv,Oded Schramm,1999,math/9904022,"Scaling Limits of Loop-Erased Random Walks and Uniform Spanning Trees. Introduces SLE$_\\kappa$ and conjectures that loop-erased random walk converges to SLE$_2$."
  2369,Lectures on the Ising and Potts Models on the Hypercubic Lattice,"https://arxiv.org/abs/1707.00520",arxiv.org,math.PR,math.PR cond-mat.stat-mech math-ph mathematics physics statistical-mechanics real-analysis lecture-notes arxiv,Hugo Duminil-Copin,2017,"1707.00520","Lectures on the Ising and Potts Models on the Hypercubic Lattice. Lecture notes on phase transitions of the Ising and Potts models through random-cluster representations, sharpness and continuity of the transition."
  2370,"Continuity of the Phase Transition for Planar Random-Cluster and Potts Models with $1 \\le q \\le 4$","https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.04159",arxiv.org,math.PR,math.PR math-ph cond-mat.stat-mech math.CA mathematics physics statistical-mechanics real-analysis quantum-mechanics arxiv,Hugo Duminil-Copin and Vladas Sidoravicius and Vincent Tassion,2015,"1505.04159","Continuity of the Phase Transition for Planar Random-Cluster and Potts Models with $1 \\le q \\le 4$. Proves the phase transition of planar FK percolation is continuous for $1 \\le q \\le 4$ via parafermionic observables and RSW estimates."
  2371,Explosive Percolation is Continuous,"https://arxiv.org/abs/1102.5306",arxiv.org,math.PR,math.PR cond-mat.stat-mech math-ph mathematics physics statistical-mechanics probabilistic-combinatorics arxiv,Oliver Riordan and Lutz Warnke,2011,"1102.5306","Explosive Percolation is Continuous. Shows Achlioptas processes have a continuous phase transition, refuting claims of discontinuous explosive percolation."
