  2375,An Introduction to Matrix Concentration Inequalities,"https://arxiv.org/abs/1501.01571",arxiv.org,math.PR,math.PR math.RA cs.DS mathematics computer-science concentration-of-measure linear-algebra probability survey book arxiv,Joel A. Tropp,2015,"1501.01571","An Introduction to Matrix Concentration Inequalities. Monograph on matrix Chernoff, Bernstein and Hoeffding inequalities via Lieb's concavity theorem."
