  2377,Regret Analysis of Stochastic and Nonstochastic Multi-Armed Bandit Problems,"https://arxiv.org/abs/1204.5721",arxiv.org,cs.LG,cs.LG math.PR stat.ML computer-science mathematics statistics online-learning-and-bandits probability book arxiv,Sébastien Bubeck and Nicolò Cesa-Bianchi,2012,"1204.5721","Regret Analysis of Stochastic and Nonstochastic Multi-Armed Bandit Problems. Monograph on UCB, Exp3, linear and convex bandits with regret bounds for stochastic and adversarial settings."
