  2379,"Convex Optimization: Algorithms and Complexity","https://arxiv.org/abs/1405.4980",arxiv.org,math.OC,math.OC cs.DS cs.LG math.MG mathematics computer-science algorithms convex-analysis optimization machine-learning book arxiv,Sébastien Bubeck,2014,"1405.4980","Convex Optimization: Algorithms and Complexity. Monograph on oracle complexity of convex optimization: cutting planes, gradient descent, mirror descent, acceleration and stochastic methods."
