  2382,"Kähler–Einstein Metrics on Fano Manifolds I: Approximation of Metrics with Cone Singularities","https://arxiv.org/abs/1211.4566",arxiv.org,math.AG,math.AG math.CV math.DG math.AP mathematics complex-geometry geometric-analysis singularities birational-geometry arxiv,Xiuxiong Chen and Simon Donaldson and Song Sun,2012,"1211.4566","Kähler–Einstein Metrics on Fano Manifolds I: Approximation of Metrics with Cone Singularities. First of three papers proving that K-stable Fano manifolds admit Kähler–Einstein metrics, via cone-angle continuity."
