  2384,Semiorthogonal Decomposition for Algebraic Varieties,"https://arxiv.org/abs/alg-geom/9506012",arxiv.org,math.AG,math.AG math.CT mathematics derived-categories algebraic-geometry category-theory arxiv,Alexei Bondal and Dmitri Orlov,1995,alg-geom/9506012,Semiorthogonal Decomposition for Algebraic Varieties. Studies semiorthogonal decompositions of $D^b(X)$ and proves the derived category determines varieties with ample or anti-ample canonical bundle.
