  2389,"The Decomposition Theorem, Perverse Sheaves and the Topology of Algebraic Maps","https://arxiv.org/abs/0712.0349",arxiv.org,math.AG,math.AG math.RT mathematics perverse-sheaves sheaf-theory survey arxiv,Mark Andrea A. de Cataldo and Luca Migliorini,2007,"0712.0349","The Decomposition Theorem, Perverse Sheaves and the Topology of Algebraic Maps. Survey of perverse sheaves, the decomposition theorem, relative hard Lefschetz and their applications."
